@@ -111,16 +114,26 @@ int ipts_control_start(struct ipts_context *ipts);
  * ipts_control_stop() - Stops the data flow and resets the device.
  * @ipts: The IPTS driver context.
  *
- * Returns: 0 on success, <0 on error.
+ * Bounded in time. Destroys the HID device and frees all buffers, unless the
